{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102708","id":2328721234,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6KzXdS","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102708","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102708.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102708.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102708","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102708/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102708/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102708/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/77fd4c1af0e99d03b261a2f074c2f106d021c216","number":102708,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add post light function for forward pipelines (useful in toon shading)","user":{"login":"HydrogenC","id":33123710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTIzNzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33123710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC","html_url":"https://github.com/HydrogenC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Added a post light function, allowing the user to calculate the final color from lighting data with custom logic, useful for NPR like cel shading. Passing varyings from `light` to `post_light` is allowed. Closes <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10527> and closes <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/484>. \r\n\r\nRender pipeline compatibility: \r\n - [X] Forward+: Supported\r\n - [X] Forward mobile: Supoorted\r\n - [X] Compatibility: Implemented, but with limitations, see also <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8050>\r\n\r\nThe following test shader produces the result in the image, notice that the ramp is be applied after all lights are accumulated: \r\n```glsl\r\nshader_type spatial;\r\n\r\nvoid vertex() {\r\n\t// Called for every vertex the material is visible on.\r\n\tPOSITION = PROJECTION_MATRIX * MODELVIEW_MATRIX * vec4(VERTEX, 1);\r\n}\r\n\r\nuniform sampler2D ramp : repeat_disable;\r\nvarying float energy;\r\n\r\nvoid fragment() {\r\n\t// Called for every pixel the material is visible on.\r\n\tenergy = 0.;\r\n}\r\n\r\nvoid post_light() {\r\n\t// Called for every pixel the material is visible on.\r\n\tfloat x = clamp(energy, 0., 1.);\r\n\tvec3 color = texture(ramp, vec2(x, 0.5)).rgb;\r\n\tOUT_COLOR = color;\r\n}\r\n\r\nvoid light() {\r\n\t// Called for every pixel for every light affecting the material.\r\n\t// Uncomment to replace the default light processing function with this one.\r\n\tenergy += clamp(dot(NORMAL, LIGHT), 0., 1.) * ATTENUATION * LIGHT_COLOR.x / PI;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n![Showcase](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2681b951-907f-48c9-82df-5f0f18881c65)\r\n\r\nP.S. : I am new to Godot source code, so I may have misunderstood how the code framework works. \r\nBesides, the current implementation is quite casual, maybe a better design could be came up with as for where in the shader to put the post light at and which built-ins to expose to the post light function.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-02-11T13:13:55Z","updated_at":"2025-04-15T10:00:08Z","closed_at":"2025-04-15T04:24:12Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a389f31c73b8613581579ee14088be34423f2f58","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"HydrogenC:post-light","ref":"post-light","repo":{"id":930935161,"node_id":"R_kgDON3zxeQ","name":"godot","full_name":"HydrogenC/godot","owner":{"login":"HydrogenC","id":33123710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTIzNzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33123710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC","html_url":"https://github.com/HydrogenC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.gith